    "body": "Not much to say here (thankfully)... a couple of typos some of which might be mine. \r\n\r\nOne thing I am still wondering about - pros/cons of using the term \"APLIC domain\" vs \"AIA interrupt domain\" (because \"interrupt domains\" is the actual term used in AIA). \r\n\r\nDefinitely stick with APLIC domains\" in this PR because it tells implementors that the behaviour of an ACLIC domain is almost identical to an APLIC domain. ",
